{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "_readme": "Regen input map (plan STREAM_QUOXPERT_PLAN.md §4). For each sub-skill: declared inputs (repo + path/cmd), which generated block(s) each source feeds, and a 'stamp' (sha256 of the source's current content + when it was last checked/regenerated). scripts/regen.mjs writes stamps after a successful regen; scripts/drift-check.mjs re-hashes at CI time and fails if a stamp is stale. Repos are resolved on disk at $QUOXPERT_REPOS_ROOT/<repo> (defaults to the parent of this checkout, i.e. sibling repos under /home/control) — see scripts/regen.mjs resolveRepoRoot(). 'stamp.sha256: null' means never regenerated yet (expected for a v0.1 scaffold with empty SKILL.md files).",
